  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "華語口語與表達",
    "sub_ename": "SPOKEN CHINESE AND ORAL EXPRESSION FOR TCSL",
    "describe_ch": "培養未來華語教師之口語表達能力；內容包含單音節、雙音節、短句、短文、短述之口語教學技巧，並安排期末分組試教。",
    "describe_eh": "This course is for prospective teachers of TCSL to prepare them for their future careers. The contents include an introduction to the theory of communication skills of single syllables, two syllables, short sentences, essays, short descriptions etc. In this course, the learners will be assigned to teaching practices in groups in the final examination.",
